  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.14 Examination Fees for Professions Regulated by the Board of Natural Scientists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.14 Examination Fees for Professions Regulated by the Board of Natural Scientists. The examination fees for the professions regulated by the board of natural scientists under RSA 310-A:75-95 shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For the soil scientist theory exam, $69; and\n\n(b) For the wetlands scientist theory exam, $69.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.12)",
